@startuml guest_use_case
title Increment 4 - Guest Records and History - Use Cases
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Receptionist" as Receptionist

rectangle "Hotel Reservation System" {
  usecase "Search Guest Records" as UC1
  usecase "View Guest Profile" as UC2
  usecase "Update Guest Profile" as UC3
  usecase "View Guest History" as UC4
  usecase "Link Returning Guest" as UC5
  usecase "Verify Guest Match" as UC6
}

Receptionist -- UC1
Receptionist -- UC2
Receptionist -- UC3
Receptionist -- UC4
Receptionist -- UC5

UC5 ..> UC6 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC6
  The receptionist confirms the match.
  Matching names/contacts alone never
  trigger an automatic link or merge.
end note
@enduml
